# Device identity: UDID, serial, the device's own name. See device.env.example.
device.env

# Host-specific configuration. See .env.example.
.env

# Local notes, not part of the published guide.
ENVIRONMENT.md

# The second screen lives in its own repository.
second-screen/

# Third-party binaries: large, and not ours to redistribute. The docs say where
